      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you and I understood about your concern.\n\nActually, there is no bug reported about it. I\u0027ve just made this CL for small improvement.\nI think that the link on phone number based on N/W country code is reasonable more.\nCould you kindly check below two cases?\n\n1. In roaming case,(SIM and N/W country are different.)\n - It will provider the link for the phone numbers dialable on current N/W only.\n - If SIM country is used instead, It will not provider the link for some dialable numbers on current N/W.\n2. No SIM case,\n - Only N/W country is available.",
